      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The observed TTPs unequivocally demonstrate the operational profile of a Tier-1 nation-state Advanced Persistent Threat group targeting critical infrastructure. Given the depth of the reconnaissance performed within the Baltic power grid environment, the threat level must be classified at High, indicating imminent risk. We are operating under the near-certainty that a disruptive payload is being prepared in preparation for kinetic operations. This decisive framing reflects the gravity of the observed adversary capabilities.",
